Cell["\<\
Accepts options of ParallelSum. Coordinate and distance conventions are the \
same as HMatrixFromHoppings.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->2001957250,ExpressionUUID->"95f14e52-5aa9-634f-8e8d-2c0c35c12054"],

Cell["\<\
Load TBMethod on subkernels and distribute user-defined hopping functions \
before a parallel calculation. The package changes $DistributedContexts when \
loaded.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1111894416,ExpressionUUID->"0d5dcbb8-9700-c244-af47-775784f0e742"],

